WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.811
Identify, explain and apply the important ideas behind find information on a page.

00:00:06.617 --> 00:00:11.600
Search engine: helps find pages about a topic. Search words: describe what

00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:12.846
information is needed.

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:18.264
Source: is where information comes from. Check evidence: helps judge whether

00:00:18.264 --> 00:00:21.999
information is reliable. Bookmark: saves a link for later.

00:00:22.867 --> 00:00:27.534
Use an imaginary example or a teacher-approved offline screenshot. Discuss when to

00:00:27.534 --> 00:00:32.980
use search engine and search words. Never enter a real password or share private

00:00:32.980 --> 00:00:34.536
details in this activity.
